{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Remains of Dahlia</strong> is a short first-person investigative psychological horror game about a husband trying to uncover the truth behind his wife\u2019s disappearance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the early 2010s, a housewife known as <strong>\u201cDahlia\u201d</strong> was reported missing after running away from home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her husband, <strong>Bowo</strong>, filed a report with the police, but the investigation yielded no results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no clear answers, Bowo decided to investigate the case on his own.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114350/extras/9c8d762ecda3b27c1d34f99ee725f1f7.poster.avif?t=1762698474\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114350/extras/9c8d762ecda3b27c1d34f99ee725f1f7.webm?t=1762698474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114350/extras/9c8d762ecda3b27c1d34f99ee725f1f7.mp4?t=1762698474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Remains of Dahlia</strong> delivers an  investigative experience through its authentic setting, where players will explore a small house and its surrounding area located in a quiet, remote suburban neighborhood in Indonesia. With its <strong>old camcorder-style visuals</strong>, the game evokes a chilling atmosphere reminiscent of a documentary capturing real events. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through <strong>investigative gameplay</strong>, players are encouraged to search every corner, uncover hidden clues, and piece together the truth behind Dahlia\u2019s disappearance while feeling the <strong>tense and oppressive silence</strong> that lingers within every step. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision and interpretation of the evidence will lead to <strong>multiple possible endings</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The Remains of Dahlia</i></strong><i> is a short game, designed to be completed roughly in under one hour.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4114350?t=1762698474","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4114350?t=1762698474","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114350/02e668d08ec15f392ac4b00b8fe1cf1fff824c92/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762698474","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114350/02e668d08ec15f392ac4b00b8fe1cf1fff824c92/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762698474","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains depictions of violence, graphic imagery, blood, and acts of murder."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Remains of Dahlia</strong> is a short first-person investigative psychological horror game about a husband trying to uncover the truth behind his wife\u2019s disappearance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the early 2010s, a housewife known as <strong>\u201cDahlia\u201d</strong> was reported missing after running away from home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her husband, <strong>Bowo</strong>, filed a report with the police, but the investigation yielded no results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no clear answers, Bowo decided to investigate the case on his own.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114350/extras/9c8d762ecda3b27c1d34f99ee725f1f7.poster.avif?t=1762698474\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114350/extras/9c8d762ecda3b27c1d34f99ee725f1f7.webm?t=1762698474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114350/extras/9c8d762ecda3b27c1d34f99ee725f1f7.mp4?t=1762698474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Remains of Dahlia</strong> delivers an  investigative experience through its authentic setting, where players will explore a small house and its surrounding area located in a quiet, remote suburban neighborhood in Indonesia. With its <strong>old camcorder-style visuals</strong>, the game evokes a chilling atmosphere reminiscent of a documentary capturing real events. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through <strong>investigative gameplay</strong>, players are encouraged to search every corner, uncover hidden clues, and piece together the truth behind Dahlia\u2019s disappearance while feeling the <strong>tense and oppressive silence</strong> that lingers within every step. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision and interpretation of the evidence will lead to <strong>multiple possible endings</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The Remains of Dahlia</i></strong><i> is a short game, designed to be completed roughly in under one hour.</i></p>","developers":["STUDIO PUZU"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114350/72e38b183a73ecd25c9dc07a070b3d2439080e58/header.jpg?t=1762698474","is_f